<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Tiger Cup Group A</p>
<p>soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Singapore: Vietnam 4 Burma 1 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Vietnam - Dang (6th, 62nd), Duc (16th), Ming (46th)</p>
<p>Burma - Htay (25th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>Indonesia 3 Cambodia 0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Kurniawan (15th), Sandria (24th), Irianto (60th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>Group standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>points:</p>
<p> Vietnam	  3  2  1  0  7</p>
<p> Indonesia	2  2  0  0  6</p>
<p> Burma	    2  1  0  1  3</p>
<p> Laos	     2  0  1  1  1</p>
<p> Cambodia	 3  0  0  3  0</p>
<p>Top two qualify for semifinals</p>
